(7497716, 1194967, 163430, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I think i have sees similar image on some Youtube videos of her songs. It could have been the same song. It would have been an interesting entry in <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_submit.php?CHALLENGE_ID=2429" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Hearty Fun</a>, as well, if setup shots were part of it.<br/> <br/>On the photographic aspects. If i was to shoot this <b>in color</b>, i would have added a tad more exposure, and a small a boost of saturation and/or contrast. Other that that, lovely shot.</td>', 'Interesting. I think i have sees similar image on some Youtube videos of her songs. It could have been the same song. It would have been an interesting entry in Hearty Fun, as well, if setup shots were part of it. On the photographic aspects. If i was to shoot this in color, i would have added a tad more exposure, and a small a boost of saturation and/or contrast. Other that that, lovely shot.', '2017-02-08 05:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
