(7498686, 1194977, 163430, '<td valign="top">Lots of potential here. <br/> <br/>What this image lacks, to me, is a bit more drama. Since the challenge is minimal editing, and lighting options are limited in the wild, there is little maneuvering space left. Me, personally, i would have went with B&amp;W. If i had time to prepare for the shot, i would have tweaked the in-camera B&amp;W conversion to add more contrast.<br/> <br/>All in all, a solid image, well fitted to the challenge and the lyrics.</td>', 'Lots of potential here.  What this image lacks, to me, is a bit more drama. Since the challenge is minimal editing, and lighting options are limited in the wild, there is little maneuvering space left. Me, personally, i would have went with B&W. If i had time to prepare for the shot, i would have tweaked the in-camera B&W conversion to add more contrast. All in all, a solid image, well fitted to the challenge and the lyrics.', '2017-02-13 09:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
